{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226630","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226630","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1222663001:1":{"text":"Sonja, could I enlist some of the Whispers girls for tonight's operation?","source_cn":"索尼娅，咱们血薇帮的姑娘，能暂时拨给我调遣吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE85705FF0CE8FF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222663002:1":{"text":"Oh? You've made progress, I see. Planning to capture that assassin tonight?","source_cn":"哦？看来事情有进展了。所以，你是打算今晚去抓捕那个杀手了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC462403691451A95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222663003:1":{"text":"Just as we suspected, the Graveborn assassin does have a weakness.","source_cn":"和我们先前的推测一样，那位亡灵杀手的确有软肋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x250A5B75E0EED2C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222663004:1":{"text":"Our spy reports she even went out of her way to shield a human woman in danger. A woman named Nalianne.","source_cn":"据探子来报，她甚至出手保护了陷入危险的人类女性——也就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75B3175B7B874DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222663005:0":{"text":"Nalianne is helping her to repay a life debt.","source_cn":"纳莉安帮助她，是为了报答救命之恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BD4856AB0B83066","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222663006:0":{"text":"A life debt... This merciless assassin seems to have a soft spot for women.","source_cn":"救命之恩……这位冷酷无情的杀手小姐对女性很心软，令人意外。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FDE58B2B6ED5418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222663007:1":{"text":"Perhaps there was someone very important to her before she became a Graveborn...","source_cn":"也许，在她那谈不上生命的生命里，曾经有过一位很重要的女...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FD9D07834FF117A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1222663007":{"text":"Perhaps there was someone very important to her before she became a Graveborn...","source_cn":"也许，在她那谈不上生命的生命里，曾经有过一位很重要的女性吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FD9D07834FF117A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222663008:1":{"text":"No... I know what I must do.","source_cn":"不……我知道自己现在该做什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74FCE75AACDF2A2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222663010:1":{"text":"Our top priority is to retrieve the Void Relic. That's our main focus.","source_cn":"我们要尽快回收班题斯圣器，这才是重中之重。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA57E373393ABD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222663011:1":{"text":"Since the assassin shows leniency towards women, whether out of compassion or a quirk, we should use that to our advantage.","source_cn":"既然那个杀手会对女性网开一面，同情也好，怪癖也罢，我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABA2099EA48FF5FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222663012:1":{"text":"Lucca, you're in charge of tonight's operation. We're relying on you.","source_cn":"卢卡，今晚的行动归你全权指挥，期待你的战果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA55E8525DE71238F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222663013:1":{"text":"Yeah, I got it.","source_cn":"是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FE54E79DA07FC41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"Thinking of Nara again?","source_cn":"又想起奈拉了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0792FB5235AF6F59","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Thinking of Nara again?","female":"Thinking of Nara again?","variant_male_record_index":"67024","variant_female_record_index":"67025","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222663009:1":{"text":"Yes... anyway...","source_cn":"你说得对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59620B11100F7FE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"It'll be better one day.","source_cn":"现在没时间伤感","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x77C6A7138CA37EEA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It'll be better one day.","female":"It'll be better one day.","variant_male_record_index":"67026","variant_female_record_index":"67027","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"Lucca","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":2}}